{"channelId":"UCQZY1gtwMMFvD6UANAqaIGw","row":["Mindful Massage Academy",206,"Welcome to Mindful Massage Academy – where massage therapists grow with purpose, presence, and practical skill.\n\nI’m Lindsay, a massage educator, mentor, and bodyworker with a passion for helping therapists build strong hands, smart businesses, and sustainable careers. This channel is your home for hands-on massage tutorials, anatomy-based techniques, self-care strategies, and honest conversations about life in the massage world.\n\nWhether you’re a new massage therapist or an experienced bodyworker ready to deepen your craft, you’re in the right place.\n\nSubscribe for weekly videos on:\n\t•\tMassage techniques & body mechanics\n\t•\tNervous-system-informed client work\n\t•\tAnatomy, assessment, & touch skills\n\t•\tBurnout prevention & business tips\n\t•\tEmbodied support for thriving therapists\n\nLet’s make this work feel good — for your clients and for you.","hello@lindsayjuarez.co","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQZY1gtwMMFvD6UANAqaIGw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQZY1gtwMMFvD6UANAqaIGw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:15.852Z","channelId":"UCQZY1gtwMMFvD6UANAqaIGw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"1de9b4781bd024cfca6f935322faf847249027999f5f457345b4d0f65513933d","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"02516cdcf0d7d673e5460cef1e3b22102b4d7d68af23ee316fa8c7346774a549"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQZY1gtwMMFvD6UANAqaIGw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:15.852Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQZY1gtwMMFvD6UANAqaIGw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":206,"raw":"206 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQZY1gtwMMFvD6UANAqaIGw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:15.852Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"hello@lindsayjuarez.co","purpose":"general","ownerRole":"unknown","identity